- op: discuss  # 283a
  at: '2026-06-30T05:20:46Z'  # 283a
  by: agent  # 283a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 283a
  clock: 4  # 283a
  nonce: 283a  # 283a
  message: "Resolved via REFRAME (doc-only), the path-2 option the item itself proposed. Merged spec change (dev fde06b3522): spec §9 (line 840-841) no longer claims io_boundary/io_primitive are 'stamped on every call edge' — it now states the behavior map's calls edges carry no io_boundary key, the classification is derived at consumer time by io_boundary.compute_boundary_map, and the io-boundaries CLI is canonical. The '0 producer-stamped' fact is now the documented contract rather than spec drift. axis_meta_keys already described the key as set by compute_boundary_map (no code change needed)."  # 283a
